{
  "$comment": "Single source of every count and version quoted in the docs, the agent files and the release notes. `npm run verify:docs` holds every document to it; `npm run release:prepare` bumps `packages.pkinative-mcp.version` and `verifiedOn`. `declared` holds figures no filesystem walk can derive (measured at release, or an inventory of the engine the verifier checks against the vendored registries under docs/data/); `derived` holds figures verify:docs recomputes from the source tree (the registry of src/tools/, the PROMPTS table, every ToolError code, server.json, examples/, tests/, the sample baseline, the corpus table) and fails when they drift. `assertions` are the prose tokens each listed file must carry verbatim. `declared.toolsListBytes` is the UTF-8 size of the built `tools/list` payload, held within 2 % by `npx tsx scripts/tool-shape.ts --check` (gate step `verify:tool-shape`), which also enforces the 448 KiB catalogue and 8 KiB instructions budgets and prints `declared.instructionsBytes`. `declared.tests` is the whole vitest suite, skipped tests included, as the gate's test-output/.gate/vitest.json counts it.",
